  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a CFG001 unsafe code fix found by evidence-based audit: when the reported section literal was a chained non-root GetSection(...) argument that itself contained a colon (e.g. .GetSection(\"Features\").GetSection(\"Sub:Strpie\")), the fix substituted only the corrected leaf for the whole multi-segment literal, silently dropping the \"Sub:\" segment and producing a still-broken binding that contradicted the fix's own label. The fix now rewrites only the anchored literal's leaf and preserves any leading colon segments, and is suppressed (diagnostic and suggestion message still shown) when the anchored expression is not a plain string literal whose segments can be reproduced safely. Diagnostic IDs and severities are unchanged.",
